          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            A jet can be thought of as the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/infinitesimal"} infinitesimal
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/germ"} germ
            of a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/section"} section
            of some
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/bundle"} bundle
            or of a map between spaces. Jets are a coordinate free version of Taylor-polynomials and Taylor series.
          %h2#definition Definition
          %h3#concrete Concrete
